{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חַד","hw":"חַד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַד</span></big>  <strong>adj. one, a</strong>;—ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:31\" href=\"/Daniel.2.31\">Dn 2:31</a> +; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>one</em> side <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:5\" href=\"/Daniel.7.5\">Dn 7:5</a>; n. om. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:3\" href=\"/Daniel.6.3\">6:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">2:9</a> = <em>one and invariable</em> (<em>inevitable</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחֲדָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:35\" href=\"/Daniel.2.35\">35</a> <em>as one, altogether</em> (so S-C<sup>K 3</sup> 𝔗, and late BH <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּאֶחָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:64\" href=\"/Ezra.2.64\">Ezr 2:64</a> +); = ordinal, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת חֲדָה</span> <em>first year</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:1\" href=\"/Ezra.7.1\">7:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:13\" href=\"/Ezra.5.13\">Ezr 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:3\" href=\"/Ezra.6.3\">6:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> = <em>a certain one</em> (τινὰ) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:16\" href=\"/Daniel.7.16\">Dn 7:16</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> partit.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>a</em> (indef. art.) c. subst. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:31\" href=\"/Daniel.2.31\">Dn 2:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:18\" href=\"/Daniel.6.18\">6:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:16\" href=\"/Daniel.4.16\">4:16</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, שָׁעָה\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_שָׁעָה\", dir=\"rtl\">שָׁעָה</a>), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:2\" href=\"/Ezra.6.2\">6:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַד שִׁבְעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:19\" href=\"/Daniel.3.19\">Dn 3:19</a> = <em>seven-fold</em> (as Syriac: Nö<sup>§ 241</sup> PS <sup>1194</sup>; cf.<a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:5\" href=\"/Exodus.16.5\">Ex 16:5</a> 𝔖), v. K<sup>§ 66, 2</sup>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, אחה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, אחד"}